<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Evergreen</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Richy Mitch &amp; The Coal Miners</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">RMCM</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">6me7F0aaZjwDo6RJ5MrfBD</ttm:item><itunes:duration>01:27.000</itunes:duration></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.890" end="00:35.390">Locked in a stalemate</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.380" end="00:41.800">With a man who bars no holds</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.800" end="00:43.820">Rock and a hard place</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.820" end="00:51.820">He's battering control</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.290" end="00:56.400">What am I waiting for</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.400" end="01:00.500">Feet planted beneath</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.500" end="01:04.500">My compass my transport</p></div></body></tt>